utor": null, "rationale": "Operator deluje kot 'robot-vzdr\u017eevalec' \u2014 sam skrbi za bazo: varnostne kopije, replikacijo, failover."}, {"id": "documentation_k3s_setup_postgresql", "label": "PostgreSQL", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documentation/k3s-setup.md", "source_location": "Poglavje 4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "documentation_k3s_setup_helm", "label": "Helm (app store za Kubernetes)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documentation/k3s-setup.md", "source_location": "Poglavje 3.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "documentation_k3s_setup_traefik", "label": "Traefik (onemogo\u010den)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documentation/k3s-setup.md", "source_location": "Poglavje 1.1 (--disable=traefik)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Onemogo\u010den (--disable=traefik), ker ga ne rabimo \u2014 zunanje IP-je dodeljuje MetalLB."}, {"id": "documentation_k3s_setup_servicelb", "label": "k3s ServiceLB (onemogo\u010den)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documentation/k3s-setup.md", "source_location": "Poglavje 1.1 (--disable=servicelb)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Onemogo\u010den, ker bi se k3s ServiceLB in MetalLB kregala za iste servise \u2014 MetalLB ne bi dobil IP-ja."}, {"id": "documentation_main_sola_db", "label": "sola-db (CNPG PostgreSQL cluster)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "documentation/k3s-setup.md", "source_location": "Poglavje 4.2 \u2014 sola-cnpg-cluster.yaml", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "instances: 2 z enablePodAntiAffinity \u2014 dve kopiji baze na razli\u010dnih ra\u010dunalnikih; failoverDelay=30s: CNPG po\u010daka 30 sekund, preden razglasi primary za mrtvega, kar p